              Table "public.order_items"
   Column   |  Type   | Collation | Nullable | Default 
------------+---------+-----------+----------+---------
 order_id   | integer |           | not null | 
 book_id    | integer |           | not null | 
 quantity   | integer |           | not null | 
 unit_price | integer |           | not null | 
Indexes:
    "order_items_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (order_id, book_id)
Check constraints:
    "order_items_quantity_check" CHECK (quantity > 0)
    "order_items_unit_price_check" CHECK (unit_price > 0)
Foreign-key constraints:
    "order_items_book_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (book_id) REFERENCES books(book_id)
    "order_items_order_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (order_id) REFERENCES orders(order_id)
[exit 0]